From c11bcfa53218b1221d1808f66ee503f92350cca1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 16:35:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix HUD/inventory disappearing, ADS stuck after firing, XM607
 sight off-centre

- UI: WeaponInspectUI's panel auto-detection walked up to the root and disabled the whole Canvas;
  scripts that sit on their own panel switched themselves off via SetActive. New UiPanelVisibility
  (CanvasGroup when the owner lives in the panel, never hides a root Canvas).
- UI: Canvas prefab and Player prefab both carried InventoryUIController/WeaponInspectUI; keep the
  Canvas one, retire the rest (fixes the 'Slot Prefab ist nicht zugewiesen' warning in ShootingRange).
- Animator (G3, M27, AKM): Fire_ADS state had no exit when IsAiming became false -> stuck in the ADS pose.
  Added FireADS -> AimingOFF (IsAiming == false).
- XM607: optic mount and iron-sight aim point moved onto the measured centre line (x=0); new opt-in
  WeaponController.autoCenterOpticLaterally centres the optic itself, enabled on the XM607.
